# Never commit key material or secrets (public repo); public keys are allowed.
**/*id_*
!**/*id_*.pub
!**/*id_*.pub.tmpl
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.kdbx
.env
.env.*
*.ppk
*.age
*credentials*
*netrc*
**/dot_kube/
**/private_dot_kube/
**/*_key
!**/*_key.pub
